  Gouv DOI are not yet available. If you use this software before publication,
  please cite this software release and update the citation to the archived DOI
  once available.

title: "Pléiades ASP Workflow"

type: software

version: "1.5.4"

date-released: "2026-09-08"

authors:
  - family-names: "Koa"
    given-names: "Islam"
    affiliation: "Université Grenoble Alpes, CNRS, IRD, INRAE, Grenoble INP, IGE, Grenoble, France; An-Najah National University, Nablus, Palestine"

  - family-names: "Recking"
    given-names: "Alain"
    affiliation: "Université Grenoble Alpes, CNRS, IRD, INRAE, Grenoble INP, IGE, Grenoble, France"

